WEBVTT

00:00:04.214 --> 00:00:04.791
Hi there!

00:00:04.791 --> 00:00:09.024
HUNGRY is an all-in-one platform
for your workplace food programs,

00:00:09.024 --> 00:00:13.515
and this Client Admin Dashboard
is where it all comes together.

00:00:13.515 --> 00:00:15.893
Whether you have Catering, Group Order,

00:00:15.893 --> 00:00:18.271
Events, or Snacks & Pantry with HUNGRY,

00:00:18.271 --> 00:00:22.357
all of your data lives in one place,
so you can see how your people

00:00:22.357 --> 00:00:26.016
are enjoying the food, which
vendors and cuisines they love,

00:00:26.016 --> 00:00:29.516
and how much you're spending
across every program.

00:00:29.516 --> 00:00:32.807
Some tabs are tagged with
a program, like Catering,

00:00:32.807 --> 00:00:37.646
Group Order, or Snacks & Pantry, and
you'll only see the tabs that apply to

00:00:37.646 --> 00:00:39.925
the programs you have.

00:00:39.925 --> 00:00:42.573
Weekly Snapshot is your week at a glance:

00:00:42.573 --> 00:00:46.449
total orders, your busiest day,
which vendors are coming in,

00:00:46.449 --> 00:00:48.257
and headcount by day.

00:00:48.257 --> 00:00:52.560
Below that, the calendar shows
every order across your locations,

00:00:52.560 --> 00:00:56.389
including live participation
for your Group Orders.

00:00:56.389 --> 00:01:01.020
For Catering orders, you can also
use Send Shareable Calendar to share

00:01:01.020 --> 00:01:06.376
your upcoming catering menus with
your office managers or your team.

00:01:06.376 --> 00:01:09.386
My Orders starts with
your Program Overview:

00:01:09.386 --> 00:01:12.464
total meals, meals
donated, on-time delivery,

00:01:12.464 --> 00:01:13.696
and vendors tried.

00:01:13.696 --> 00:01:19.278
Use the Programs and Date Range filters
to look at one site or all of them.

00:01:19.278 --> 00:01:22.179
Below that is every
order, with its status,

00:01:22.179 --> 00:01:25.148
date, headcount, amount,
and invoice status.

00:01:25.148 --> 00:01:29.983
Use Export to download the list
for finance or procurement.

00:01:29.983 --> 00:01:32.482
Consumption is available for Catering.

00:01:32.482 --> 00:01:35.178
This weekly grid shows, by food category,

00:01:35.178 --> 00:01:38.006
where you had leftovers,
got it just right,

00:01:38.006 --> 00:01:42.018
or ran out, so you can
right-size future orders.

00:01:42.018 --> 00:01:45.163
If you have Group Order,
Manage Users is where you

00:01:45.163 --> 00:01:48.183
control who can order,
and from which locations.

00:01:48.183 --> 00:01:52.849
You can see each person's locations
and whether they've registered.

00:01:52.849 --> 00:01:56.626
You can assign users to
locations and resend welcome

00:01:56.626 --> 00:02:00.606
emails to anyone who
hasn't registered yet.

00:02:00.606 --> 00:02:02.687
Service is for Snacks & Pantry.

00:02:02.687 --> 00:02:06.044
Pick a location and date
to see the service level,

00:02:06.044 --> 00:02:10.408
employee count, your Happiness
Manager, and every completed task,

00:02:10.408 --> 00:02:12.941
with who did it and when.

00:02:12.941 --> 00:02:18.410
Reviews shows how people are enjoying the
food: meal ratings, trends, and feedback.

00:02:18.410 --> 00:02:24.079
Switch between Catering and Group
Order to see how each program is doing.

00:02:24.079 --> 00:02:26.685
Billing is where you manage your spend.

00:02:26.685 --> 00:02:29.826
See total spend and
average spend per employee,

00:02:29.826 --> 00:02:35.106
with a tab for each program, plus cost
per unit and per serving for your Snacks

00:02:35.106 --> 00:02:36.761
& Pantry products.

00:02:36.761 --> 00:02:39.525
Further down, you'll find every invoice.

00:02:39.525 --> 00:02:44.596
Filter by paid or unpaid, or
use Export to download them all.

00:02:44.596 --> 00:02:47.195
And that's your Client Admin Dashboard:

00:02:47.195 --> 00:02:50.794
every program, every location,
and every dollar in one

00:02:50.794 --> 00:02:51.194
place.

00:02:51.194 --> 00:02:54.993
If you have any questions,
reach out to your HUNGRY team.

00:02:54.993 --> 00:02:57.326
Thanks for watching!
